  "body": "This PR adds CanvasRenderingContext2D.getContextAttributes() and an explanation, aligning it with the homonimous WebGLRenderingContext [section](https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/#5.14.2) and  addressing #2563.\n\nThis is essentially a refry of https://github.com/WICG/canvas-color-space/blob/master/CanvasColorSpaceProposal.md#feature-detection and it's a step to ship what Chromium already implements ([idl file](https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/canvas/canvas2d/canvas_rendering_context_2d.idl?type=cs&q=getcontextattributes+idl&sq=package:chromium&g=0&l=142)).\n\n+@kenrussell, @domenic\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4253/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 4, 2019, 8:25 PM UTC (f48817d)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4253/4fd4d3d...f48817d/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 4, 2019, 8:25 PM UTC (f48817d)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4253/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 4, 2019, 8:25 PM UTC (f48817d)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4253/4fd4d3d...f48817d/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 4, 2019, 8:25 PM UTC (f48817d)\">diff</a> )",
